CastingLadleNozzleMaker.ironStock=18; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.bronzeStock=14; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.woodStock=10; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.leatherStock=8; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.silverStock=8; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.goldStock=6; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.jewelStock=4; CastingLadleNozzleMaker.pearlStock=4
